### TeamForge Phase 13 API Tests (REST Client Format)
### Task Review & Feedback (Mandatory Rejection Reason, In Review Retention on Leave/Suspend, 3d Reminder & 7d Auto-Approve, Late Unassign Reason, Due Date Role Whitelist)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@superUserToken = Bearer YOUR_SUPERUSER_TOKEN_HERE
@ownerToken = Bearer YOUR_OWNER_TOKEN_HERE
@collabToken = Bearer YOUR_COLLABORATOR_TOKEN_HERE

### --------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. TASK REVIEW: REJECTION REASON VALIDATION & APPROVAL
### --------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1a. Reject Submitted Task Without Reason
# Expected Status: 400 Bad Request
# Expected Code: REASON_REQUIRED
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks/TASK_ID/review
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}
x-user-id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "reject"
}

###

### 1b. Reject Submitted Task With Valid Reason (10 to 500 characters)
# Expected Status: 200 OK
# Stores rejectionReason, rejectedAt, rejectedBy, rejectionHistory[] and notifies collaborator
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks/TASK_ID/review
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}
x-user-id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "reject",
  "reason": "Please add unit tests for the new validation path and update error handling."
}

###

### 1c. Resubmit Proof (Clears Visible Rejection Reason While Preserving History)
# Expected Status: 200 OK
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/TASK_ID/status
Authorization: {{collabToken}}
x-user-id: 2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "In Review",
  "proofLink": "https://github.com/org/repo/pull/22"
}

###

### 1d. Owner Approves Task
# Expected Status: 200 OK
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks/TASK_ID/review
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}
x-user-id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "approve"
}

###

### --------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. ROLE WHITELIST ON TASK UPDATE (DUE DATE LOCK)
### --------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2a. Collaborator Attempts to Change Due Date
# Expected Status: 403 Forbidden
# Expected Code: FORBIDDEN_FIELD
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/TASK_ID
Authorization: {{collabToken}}
x-user-id: 2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dueDate": "2027-06-01T00:00:00.000Z"
}

###

### 2b. Owner Changes Due Date
# Expected Status: 200 OK
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/TASK_ID
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}
x-user-id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dueDate": "2027-05-15T00:00:00.000Z"
}

###

### --------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. UNASSIGN / DROP TASK (24-HOUR LATE-DROP RULE)
### --------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3a. Collaborator Unassigns Within 24h Without Reason
# Expected Status: 400 Bad Request
# Expected Code: REASON_REQUIRED
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks/TASK_ID/unassign
Authorization: {{collabToken}}
x-user-id: 2
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### 3b. Collaborator Unassigns Within 24h With Reason (10 to 300 chars)
# Expected Status: 200 OK
# Returns task to Unassigned / To Do and notifies owner with reason
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks/TASK_ID/unassign
Authorization: {{collabToken}}
x-user-id: 2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Blocked by an unforeseen urgent commitment and need to hand off."
}

###

### --------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. HOURLY SCHEDULER TICK (reviewDeadlineJob)
### --------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 4a. Trigger Hourly Tick (Runs 3d Review Reminder & 7d Auto-Approve Job)
# Expected Status: 202 Accepted
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/jobs/tick
Authorization: {{superUserToken}}
x-user-id: u-superuser
